# Median family net wealth by racial/ethnic cohort — NLSY79, waves 1985 / 1990 / 1996

**PRIMARY units: nominal dollars exactly as recorded in the file.** Constant 1996$ shown as a
secondary column only (CPI-U annual averages, 1982-84=100: 1985=107.6, 1990=130.7, 1996=156.9
=> x1.458 / x1.200 / x1.000). Within-wave ratios are invariant to the deflator.

Cohort labels: 3 = NON-BLACK NON-HISPANIC -> "white" (label caveat: also contains small
Asian/Native American/other groups NLSY79 does not separate); 1 = black; 2 = Hispanic. Race fixed at 1979.

